==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.26.0|
* Intensity Stacks are now lost every 0.5 seconds while Moving (previously every 0.25 seconds).
}}
{{Version history table row|3.16.0|
* The notable, Intensity is removed from the main passive skill tree. Existing item anointed with Intensity , would allocate Infused Flesh instead. This does not affect the cluster jewel version of the Intensity.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.12.0|
* Intensity now has a maximum of 3 stacks (from 4).
* Intensity is no longer tied to {{il|Intensify Support}}, as skills such as {{il|Crackling Lance}} can utilise Intensity.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.11.0|
* The related notable passive skill [[Intensity (passive skill)|Intensity]] has been moved to the main skill tree. The cluster jewel counterpart can no longer be spawned on new item. {{Undocumented}}
}}
{{Version history table row|3.10.1d|
* Fixed a bug where {{il|Shock Nova}} and {{il|Blade Blast}}'s skill effects were not the correct visual size when cast with 9 or more stacks of Intensity.
* Fixed an instance crash that could occur when using {{il|Blade Vortex}} while you had 9 or more stacks of Intensity.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.10.0|
* Maximum stack of Intensity can now be scaled by the cluster jewel notable [[Intensity (passive skill)|Intensity]]. {{Undocumented}}
}}
{{Version history table row|3.6.0|
* Introduced to the game
}}
{{Version history table end}}

